            "review_title": "Review at Daebak Korean Restaurant",
            "review_text": "준혁 안\n5 contributions\n0\nKorean restaurant with a great atmosphere\nJul 2023 • Family\nIf you want to eat Korean food at Inam University, it's the best!!!\nThe end of the Hoan Kiem tourist course is always a big hit.. haha\nYou can eat really delicious k-BBQ in a comfortable atmosphere. This time I had daechang and tripe and it was really fresh and delicious. I highly recommend it.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten September 19, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
