            "review_text": "Quân Vũ\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nWe had a great time, 5 out of 5\nJan 2023 • Couples\nDespite being really busy at the end of the year, staffs did a really really great job at taking care of their customers, our order come fast and they stay to help us with the BBQ even without us asking, it’s their job, yes, but they manage everything so well that there is nothing I can complain. Food is fresh and delicious, price is a bit high compare to other places but I think it’s worth it\nRead more\nWritten January 19, 2023",
